---
// Payment Plans — Clearview V3b (2026-11-17), shared by /payment-plans and
// /es/opciones-de-pago/ (old URLs). Each language keeps its old page's text
// word for word (they differ: only the Spanish page mentions the $50 deposit).
// The old "Make a One-Time Payment" button pointed at /pay/, a payment page
// that isn't part of this site — add `oneTimePaymentUrl` below once the
// client gives the payment link. The CareCredit banner (an external GIF on
// the old site) is a styled card linking to CareCredit's application.
// Cherry financing widget (2026-11-19): same account and sections as the old
// English page, where it sat between the note and CareCredit. The old Spanish
// page had no Cherry widget, so /es/ keeps without it (the widget is English).
import PageHeaderBanner from "../PageHeaderBanner.astro";
import CtaBand from "../CtaBand.astro";
import type { Lang } from "../../data/i18n";

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const es = lang === "es";
const oneTimePaymentUrl: string | undefined = undefined;
const CARECREDIT = "https://www.carecredit.com/apply/";
---

<PageHeaderBanner heading={es ? "Opciones de pago" : "Payment Plans"} eyebrow={es ? "Pague a su manera" : "Get care now, pay later"} />

<section class="pp-sec">
  <div class="pp-wrap">
    {es ? (
      <div class="pp-card" data-reveal>
        <h2>Deposito para cita</h2>
        <p>Sabemos que tu agende puede tener algunos cambios Por favor llamanos para re-agendar o cancelar tu cita Se requiere una tarifa no reembolsable de $50 para respetar el tiempo y brindarle a usted y su mascota nuestra total atención.</p>
        <p class="pp-note">Se perderá la cita si el tutor llega más de 30 minutos después de la hora programada sin avisar.</p>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <div class="pp-card" data-reveal>
        <p class="pp-note">Note: An appointment is forfeited if an owner arrives more than 30 min after their scheduled apt time without calling.</p>
        {oneTimePaymentUrl && <a class="btn btn--cta" href={oneTimePaymentUrl}>Make a One-Time Payment</a>}
      </div>
    )}

    {/* Payment methods + insurance, from the onboarding form (2026-11-24). */}
    <div class="pp-card" data-reveal>
      {es ? (
        <>
          <h2>Formas de pago</h2>
          <p>Aceptamos efectivo, tarjetas de crédito y planes de pago a través de Cherry y CareCredit.</p>
          <p>No facturamos directamente a las compañías de seguros para mascotas, pero con gusto le damos la documentación que necesita para enviar su reclamo a su aseguradora y solicitar el reembolso.</p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <h2>Payment Methods</h2>
          <p>We accept cash, credit cards, and payment plans through Cherry and CareCredit.</p>
          <p>We don’t bill pet insurance companies directly, but we’ll gladly provide the documentation you need to submit a claim to your insurer for reimbursement.</p>
        </>
      )}
    </div>

    {!es && (
      <div class="pp-card pp-card--cherry">
        <div class="cherry" id="all"></div>
      </div>
    )}

    <div class="pp-card pp-card--cc" data-reveal>
      {es ? <h2>Opciones de pago diferido de CareCredit</h2> : <h2>CareCredit</h2>}
      {es ? (
        <p>Es difícil cuando quieres brindarle la mejor atención a tu mascota pero tienes que tomar decisiones basadas en lo que puedes pagar. CareCredit ofrece diversas formas para obtener ayuda con las facturas que puede generar el serviciol veterinario y que su mascota pueda recibir la atención que necesita. Haga clic en el banner a continuación para aplicar.</p>
      ) : (
        <p>It’s difficult when you want to provide the best care for your pet but have to make decisions based on what you can afford. CareCredit provides ways to get help with vet bills so your pet can get the care they need. Click the banner below to apply</p>
      )}
      <a class="pp-banner paws paws--light" href={CARECREDIT} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="pp-banner__brand">CareCredit</span>
        <span class="pp-banner__text">{es ? "Solicite CareCredit en línea" : "Apply for CareCredit online"}</span>
        <span class="btn btn--cta pp-banner__btn">{es ? "Aplicar" : "Apply Now"} →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<CtaBand lang={lang} heading={es ? "¿Listo para agendar" : "Ready to book"} accent={es ? "su visita?" : "your visit?"} text={es ? "Agende en línea en minutos o llámenos; con gusto le ayudamos." : "Book online in minutes or give us a call — we’re happy to help."} />

{!es && (
  <script is:inline>
    // Cherry widget (old site's account + sections); renders into #all. Its
    // primary color follows the site's --main token.
    (function (w, d, s, o, f, js, fjs) {
      w[o] = w[o] || function () { (w[o].q = w[o].q || []).push(arguments); };
      (js = d.createElement(s)), (fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0]);
      js.id = o; js.src = f; js.async = 1;
      fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);
    })(window, document, "script", "_hw", "https://files.withcherry.com/widgets/widget.js");
    var main = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue("--main").trim();
    _hw(
      "init",
      {
        debug: false,
        variables: { slug: "clearview-animal-hospital", name: "Clearview Animal Hospital" },
        styles: { primaryColor: main, secondaryColor: main + "10", fontFamily: "Open Sans" },
      },
      ["all", "hero", "howitworks", "testimony", "faq", "calculator"]
    );
  </script>
)}

<style>
  .pp-sec { padding-block: 5rem; overflow-x: clip; }
  .pp-wrap { inline-size: min(var(--container-max-narrow), 100% - 2.5rem); margin-inline: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-xl); }
  .pp-card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--light-grey); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 2.5rem; }
  .pp-card h2 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-md); }
  .pp-card p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-md); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .pp-card > :last-child { margin-block-end: 0; }
  .pp-note { border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--cta); padding-inline-start: var(--space-md); color: var(--main); font-weight: 600; }
  .pp-banner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg); margin-block-start: var(--space-lg); padding: 1.75rem 2rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--main); color: var(--white); }
  .pp-banner:hover { color: var(--white); }
  .pp-banner__brand { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-tight); }
  .pp-banner__text { flex: 1; color: var(--on-dark-muted); }
  .pp-banner__btn { color: var(--on-cta); }
  .pp-banner:hover .pp-banner__btn { background: var(--cta-hover); }
  /* Cherry lays its photo (360px) and panel (650px min) side by side for the
     viewport width, wider than this column, so it always stacks here (ported
     from Acton). Its class names carry a build hash: match the stable prefix. */
  .pp-card--cherry { padding-block: 1.5rem; }
  .cherry { max-inline-size: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
  .cherry :global([class*="main-widget_layout"]) { flex-direction: column !important; align-items: stretch !important; gap: var(--space-lg) !important; max-inline-size: 100% !important; padding-inline: 0 !important; margin-inline: 0 !important; }
  .cherry :global([class*="heroImage-image_container"]) { min-inline-size: 0 !important; inline-size: min(100%, 20rem) !important; margin-inline: 0 !important; }
  .cherry :global([class*="main-widgets_container"]) { min-inline-size: 0 !important; inline-size: 100% !important; max-inline-size: 100% !important; margin-inline: 0 !important; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .pp-sec { padding-block: 3.5rem; } .pp-card { padding: 1.75rem; } }
</style>
